 "summary": "The new stable-range results (indexed product, Dedekind-finiteness, unit form, endomorphism and matrix rings, semisimple rings, Jacobson lifting, semilocal) have no counterpart in Mathlib or Tau Ceti, and the proofs reuse the available Wedderburn\u2013Artin, opposite-matrix, lattice-complement, projective-lifting and noncommutative Jacobson API. The only overlaps found (Mathlib `isUnit_of_sub_one_mem_jacobson`, Tau Ceti `IsCoprime.exists_isUnit_add_mul` and `hasStableRangeLE_one_of_finite_maximalSpectrum`) are commutative-only and cannot replace these general-ring results.",
